WEBVTT

00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:03.620
Fest
Girls'
Okanoue

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:04.350
The hell?
Fest
Girls'
Okanoue

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.660
You expect us to wear this in front of everyone?

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:10.850
It suits all of you well!

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:12.780
So proletariat!

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:16.420
Onsa-chan, what's a "proletariat?"

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:18.240
Well, it's probably like art,

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.790
so it's probably something very artistic.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:22.960
Probably professional art, sort of.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:42.310
この坂を上り切ったら
kono saka o noborikittara

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:46.270
必ず見える景色が好きだって
kanarazu mieru keshiki ga suki datte

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:46.310
必ず見える景色が好きだって

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:52.440
背中に羽を持つあの子も言って笑ってた
senaka ni hane o motsu ano ko mo itte waratteta

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:56.110
ドキドキが一瞬で
dokidoki ga isshun de

00:00:56.110 --> 00:01:00.200
トキメキになっていくんだなんて
tokimeki ni natteikunda nante

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:03.910
あの頃は信じられなくて
ano koro wa shinjirarenakute

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:08.880
ただ見惚れていたよ
tada mitoreteita yo

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:13.510
このスピードに乗せた体温が
kono supiido ni noseta taion ga

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:17.260
今全身で伝う　通じ合う
ima zenshin de tsutau tsuujiau

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:20.890
物語の鍵はこの手に
monogatari no kagi wa kono te ni

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:24.390
ぎゅっと強く握っているから
gyutto tsuyoku nigitteiru kara

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:28.100
感じて　応えて　風になる
kanjite kotaete kaze ni naru

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:31.770
空に溶けて海を抱きしめる
sora ni tokete umi o dakishimeru

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:35.700
新しい世界が見えるはず
atarashii sekai ga mieru hazu

00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:42.790
さぁ確かめに行ってみよう
saa tashikame ni ittemiyou

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:53.800
Cultural Festival!!
Episode 7

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.670
Half a lap around the field,
Cultural Festival!!
Episode 7

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:57.880
and then straight from the
gym to the club buildings.
Cultural Festival!!
Episode 7

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:58.550
and then straight from the
gym to the club buildings.

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:00.890
Around the school from the bike parking lot,

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:03.770
through the inner yard, and back to the field.

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:06.100
We're doing ten laps on this route?

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:10.770
And we'll have boards on
the stairs to make slopes.

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:13.520
There's one up and one down.

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:17.950
I'm counting on you to make some cool jumps.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.320
Jumps?!

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:22.370
Eh? But jumps are impossible
with a large motorcycle license!

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:24.490
Even with them it's impossible.

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:26.370
What's this?

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:32.130
That's the "Boards That Lower A Bike's Engine
Temperature When You Drive Over Them"!

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:35.880
All thanks to the prowess
of Minowa Group Technologies.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:38.590
Stop wasting money on nonsense.

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.390
Now, time to do business.

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:44.510
Buy me!

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:47.350
Buy me, please!

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:50.100
Buy me!

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:51.690
Buy me, please!

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:53.440
Yeah, I'm not yelling that.
Buy me, please!

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.980
She has a good idea, though.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.530
Nobody knows which one of us
is the most likely to win.

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:01.240
No one's gonna be interested in the race

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:03.370
when there's no one to cheer for.

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.660
First we'll start with my class.

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:16.000
You want me to place a bet
on the Bike Club derby?

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:16.880
Kawasaki Raimu

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:17.880
Huh...

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.680
Everyone can only bet on one, huh?

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:23.390
I don't know anything about bikes, though.

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:25.810
Even if you don't know anything

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:29.100
you must know The Japanese Big Four.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:32.230
The four domestic manufacturers...

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:35.060
Honda, Yamaha, Kawasaki...

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:38.110
Oh, and Mr. Harley David-san.

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:39.780
What?

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:41.530
It starts with an "S"!

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:44.570
I know! It's "Scooter"!

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:47.030
Oh yeah, I see those a lot.

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:48.910
Scooter bikes.

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:51.120
"Scooter" isn't even a brand!

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:51.330
It's Suzuki! Suzuki!

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:53.080
Suzuki
It's Suzuki! Suzuki!

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.880
You're kidding, right?

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:58.300
I had no idea Suzuki made bikes.

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:00.510
Are you doing this on purpose?!

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:03.510
Well then, let's introduce the bikes!

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:08.640
First up is Honda, riding the
CB400 Super Four, Sakura Hane!

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:11.480
Promoting safe riding with

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:14.440
eighteen signals, 10 mirrors, and 8 mufflers.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:18.610
Next up is the Yamaha TZR250!

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:20.030
Amano Onsa.

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:22.490
20 years of tuning experience and riding

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:25.160
the 3ma, which is even faster than the 3xv!

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:28.830
Suzuki Katana 400: Suzunoki Rin.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:31.750
It may look normal, but thanks to a gun spark,

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.210
it feels like a whopping 1200cc!

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:38.290
Representing Kawasaki with the Epsilon 250.

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:39.550
Raimu-senpai.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:42.880
She's not riding her Ninja due to a handicap!

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:45.680
Kindly brought to you by Nikoichi Motors!

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:48.140
So that's the handicap she was talking about.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.640
I'll go with this Honda.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:51.390
Say what?!

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:53.310
I'll do my best to win!

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:57.230
With eight pointless mufflers just for looks

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.570
and the mirrors taking safety to the extreme,

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:02.860
it almost seems intellectual,
like a satire on modern society.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:04.990
What's a "satire?"

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:07.320
I think I'll go for the Yamaha.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:09.410
Oh, are you sure you wanna bet on me?

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:10.950
I'll go with the Kawasaki.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:11.790
Honda!

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:12.660
Yamaha!

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.790
Hmph! Fine!

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:18.790
If you won't see the magnificence of Suzuki,
go ahead and vote for them, I won't stop you!

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:21.840
I'll bet on you.

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:26.840
You didn't even know Suzuki
made bikes a few minutes ago.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:30.680
I didn't. But I do now.

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:34.980
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:37.310
Moms and Dads!

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:40.570
We have now reached the main event!

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:43.530
The first-ever, highschool girl bike derby

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.860
with all the manufacturers, against each other!

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:47.490
Your host:

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:52.540
Queen Hijirian of Evil!

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:55.710
These noble school grounds have become a

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:58.370
race circuit swirling with excitement!

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:01.210
Watch as these daredevils straddle their

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:03.750
I wonder how many people
came to see us race.
iron horses and compete for who's the fastest!

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:04.800
I wonder how many people
came to see us race.

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:06.050
A hundred!

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:07.340
Probably not.

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:08.720
Probably fifty at most.

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:11.180
Probably no one came.

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:13.600
Here are the innocent proletarian

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:18.230
girl racers at your service!

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:37.710
Onee-chan, do your best!

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:40.750
The winner will be that bike over there.

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:44.710
How is this even happening...

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:48.380
So many people came to cheer us on...

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:52.140
I can't give up, even if I crash...

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:55.140
I can't lose now.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:58.770
Even the girls who didn't even know
all the manufacturer names,

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:02.100
placed bets and started cheering!

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:05.520
Just watch me!! I'll make you
regret betting on anyone

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.070
but Suzuki!

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:08.940
Onee-chan!

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.320
Yume!

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:15.370
Come to think of it, I wonder if Raimu-senpai

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:18.580
has any friends cheering her on..?

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:31.970
It's about to start.

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:35.140
Huh?

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:38.520
It's King and Push Start Boss.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.310
What are you looking at?

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:42.020
If it isn't Pierced Monkey.

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:45.480
We're watching these Japanese School Girls race.

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:51.150
A CB, a Katana, and a big scooter.

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:54.410
The two-stroke TZR is gonna win, right?

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.370
Well, normally it would.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.700
But the winner will be

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:03.460
this scooter.

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:04.790
Are you serious?

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:08.000
You don't know Raimu-senpai, do you?

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:10.420
We've never won

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:13.630
against her, either.

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:22.310
Have you all placed your bets?

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:24.690
It's just about time for final bets.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.980
What's the situation, Saruyama-sensei?

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:31.150
Principal.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.700
It's a great success!

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:36.870
Most students and guests have
already placed their bets.

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.200
What are the odds?

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:41.660
Honda is the most popular.

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:44.420
While Kawasaki is the least.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:47.920
11 to 1...

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:49.710
Just as expected.

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.050
Not only is the handicap a scooter,

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:53.920
but almost no one knows Raimu-senpai,
Have you spoken to Raimu-senpai?

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:54.220
Nope

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:54.470
so almost no one bets on her.
Have you spoken to Raimu-senpai?

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:54.970
Bike Club
Yes

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:55.470
I've heard rumors
that people have
talked to her

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:55.720
No
Answer

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:56.510
Neither

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:56.890
Have you spoken to Raimu-senpai?

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:56.930
I've heard rumors
that people have
talked to her
No
Answer
Neither

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:59.970
Since the teachers are participating as well,

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:02.020
would you like to join in, too?

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:08.190
Oh look, I had some loose
change in my pocket.

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:08.900
I wonder who to bet on....

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.570
Honda
Yamaha
Suzuki
Kawasaki

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:13.280
I'll just make a choice with my <b>eyes</b> closed.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:16.860
What! I'm going with the
least likely to win, Kawasaki.

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:19.120
That came out of my parents pension!

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:22.540
All I had to say was "I'm getting married"
and they happily forked it over!

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:23.870
Honda
Yamaha
Suzuki
Kawasaki

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:27.790
Kawasaki just became most likely to win.

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:29.210
She's 1 to 1 now?!

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.260
And now it's time!

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:36.010
The bikes are fired up!

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:44.430
Just who will be the first to complete
10 laps and claim the title of "the fastest"?

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:46.940
Let's find out!

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.390
N-No...

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:21.930
Why?

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:31.980
Ba
kuon<i>!!</i>

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:36.030
Ba
kuon<i>!!</i>

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:41.660
Raimu's Kawasaki Epsilon just got into a huge crash!

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:45.950
The Okanoue-all-girls bike
derby is off to a dramatic start!

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:51.170
I hope Raimu-senpai's safe.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:53.340
I'm worried too, but there's nothing we can do.

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:56.710
We have to focus on the race.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:59.680
Suzunoki's on her Katana 400 is the first

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:02.260
of the three remaining to burst into the first corner!

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:04.970
What's this? Are they afraid of falling?

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.640
They've all slowed down to a crawl.

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:13.060
Hane's Super Four has all of its turn signals on!

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:16.900
Next, we have the rising slope.

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:21.860
Will it be Amano's Yamaha TZR
making a graceful jump,

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:24.870
or Suzunoki's Suzuki Katana?

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:28.620
I suppose being safe is first and foremost.

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:34.590
The race continues behind the school building.

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:36.840
They're going into the long straight!

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:40.800
Go!

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:50.020
Whooa! Suzunoki is taking a generous lead here!

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.850
She's now the only one in first place!

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:59.610
I'll just stay behind Rin while we're riding safe

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:02.030
and pass her at the very end!

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:10.700
The three racers have returned to the field.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.580
And back to their slow pace down the slope...

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:18.670
And next, a bonus!

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:21.630
Minowa Group's newly developed:

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:27.100
"Roll-Above-It-And-Your-Bike's-Engine-Will-Somehow-Be-Cooled-Down Board"

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:33.310
No way I'm going over that creepy thing.

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.820
Nine laps left!

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:47.280
They're going slower than I imagined.

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:49.620
How fast were you imagining?

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:53.960
About as fast as the F1 racers that I saw
with my parents when I was little.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:58.710
It's easier to see them when
they're going slower, though.

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:04.430
Onsa-chan's bike is

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:07.140
definitely broken.

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:10.470
I have to find a way out of this smoke.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:13.270
Oh, I know!

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:16.060
If I take the lead,

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:18.440
all my problems will be solved!

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:30.700
The engine noise changed!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:42.300
Schwiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiing!

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:49.340
How?!

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:10.620
And she's still down.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:15.080
You've gotta be kidding me, Senpai.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:16.500
Get up!

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:18.460
Senpai!

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:33.640
Don't...

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:38.140
Don't give up!

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:43.570
What's this?

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:47.440
Raimu has stood up!

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:05.130
What the hell is she doing?

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:08.010
Raimu-senpai's riding technique

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:09.970
is fundamentally different from ours.

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:12.470
Every bike sacrifices

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:15.180
its life before of her.

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:17.350
It's like she has a

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:20.810
reason to win, now.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.860
Unbelievable! She's back!

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:29.990
Raimu has made a beautiful comeback!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:32.610
Senpai! Senpai!

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:33.530
Don't give up!

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:38.540
And get me back the three million yen
I tricked my parents into giving me!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:40.750
She's jumped the slope!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:51.880
Eh?!

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:52.630
What the?!

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:54.260
She's so fast!

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:57.970
She's passed everyone at incredible speeds!

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:00.600
Was that about Mach 1?

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:02.190
Maybe a little slower.

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:05.110
It's too early to make a move!

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:07.320
But I gotta get serious now!

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:13.070
Amano seems to be catching
up to Suzunoki who's in the lead!

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:14.570
Can she pass her?

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:15.910
Damn it!

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:19.040
Why can't I pass a plain old Katana 400 at all!

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:21.160
My Katana ain't plain or old at all!

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.580
I have a gun spark and hot plasma installed

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:27.290
to give it the power of the original!

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.130
Now that's occult tuning.

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:33.130
I believe in my Katana's power!

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:34.760
The bike I chose,

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:37.800
my bike's manufacturer, is the best!

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:40.390
I chose the best bike in the world!

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:42.640
And I'm going

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:45.600
to prove that in this race!

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:52.070
What are you, stupid?

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:55.530
Why would anyone take this race so seriously?!

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:01.500
I gotta say it though, it's kinda cool!

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:04.080
Not many people can talk like that.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:09.170
Still, you're not the one who gets to talk big.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.460
It has to be me!

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:19.220
The two leading bikes have returned!

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:23.140
They've entered the final lap!

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:26.400
Where is my three million yen?

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:28.560
Oh, my! Here she comes!

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:34.190
I never knew big scooters could go so fast.

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:36.780
Normally it'd overheat.

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:42.290
I think the bike's working extra hard for her.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:49.170
The two lead bikes have just
gone down the final slope.

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.500
And here comes Sakura!

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:55.470
But she's not going to catch up
unless she picks up the pace.

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:03.060
Has Sakura made up her mind

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:05.930
to jump this slope?

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:12.610
Onee-chan...

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:18.740
Onee-chan,

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:21.030
your bike has wings!

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:30.130
Incoooommmmming!!!

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:34.380
And she caught up right at the last minute!

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:38.930
And...

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:42.890
And Raimu takes the jump too!

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:47.980
And it seems she's caught up to the three!

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:52.810
Ah! And she's going to go onto the "Roll-Above-It-

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:01.160
Raimu's engine has exploded!

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:02.990
The three remaining are neck and neck!

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:08.580
But Raimu's falling right to the goal!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:15.460
Can you handle losing?!

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:18.840
Go, my Katana!

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:22.260
I've come this far, I want to win!

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:28.230
They all crossed at once!

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:30.640
At the same time!

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:32.650
To be exact, <i>almost</i> at the same time!

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:34.690
First?

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:36.360
Who's first!?

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.900
It was the Yamaha I bet on, right?

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:40.990
No, the Honda was faster.

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:44.990
What are you talking about?
Didn't you see my Kawasaki's suicide goal?

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:46.990
No, the Suzuki was in the lead.

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:49.830
Phew! Who the hell won...?

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:51.920
The Honda bike won!

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:53.920
The Yamaha bike won!

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:55.960
The Suzuki bike won!

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:57.550
The Kawasaki bike won!
They're fighting.

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:58.380
No only that, but they're fighting
over which bike is the best!
The Kawasaki bike won!

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:00.300
No only that, but they're fighting
over which bike is the best!

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:01.340
Why?

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.930
This is a miracle!

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:06.970
Girls who weren't interested in bikes at all

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:08.810
are now fighting to death over them...

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:12.100
The picture taken at the finish is here.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:13.190
The winner is...

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:20.150
the Suzuki Katana 400: Suzunoki Rin!

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:32.500
Suzuki won!

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:36.130
And everyone of you who chose Suzuki won!

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:42.130
Now everyone knows who the best maker is!

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:43.760
Choose Suzukis!

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:45.590
Buy Suzukis!

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:49.470
Okay, I'll ask my dad to buy me a Wagon R!

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:52.520
I'll make my boyfriend buy a Swift next.

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:54.560
What else does Suzuki sell, again?

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:57.150
Muneo House? Suzuki House?

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.020
What about bikes?!

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:03.780
Aww, Onee-chan lost.

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:07.990
You were right when you
said the Suzuki would win...

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:10.080
Huh?

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:12.910
You were wrong.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:14.290
What the...

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:20.090
I can still use my powers as principal
to make this race invalid!

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:22.380
I cannot allow betting at school!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:25.430
Yay, I won!

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:29.220
It's not much, but I'll add it to my wedding fund.

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:40.520
You owe me three million, Raimu-senpai.

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:43.900
Hey, how'd you do?

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:44.740
I won.

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:45.990
Wow!

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:48.450
I'm gonna go cash in.

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:52.790
Hey, Chisame-chan, you're coming
to this school next year, right?

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:55.580
Because you can come by bike?

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:57.330
Bikes aren't meant

00:21:57.330 --> 00:22:00.000
to be ridden on public roads.

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:10.800
buon!  buon!  buon!  buon!  buoon!

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:13.770
FURU SUROTTORU de iin janai?

00:22:13.890 --> 00:22:15.600
buon!  buon!  buon!  buon!  buoon!

00:22:15.680 --> 00:22:18.480
todorokima~su, bakuon!!

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:21.020
joushi koukousei BAIKU nori

00:22:21.060 --> 00:22:23.650
kaze o kiri hashiri dashichau yo  (buoon!)

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:25.320
METTO o kabutte  (buoon!)

00:22:25.360 --> 00:22:28.150
hora ne HEASUTAIRU pettanko

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:29.700
ii koto nashi kamo?

00:22:29.700 --> 00:22:32.780
itsudatte MENTE de kigen o tonnai to  (buoon!)

00:22:32.830 --> 00:22:36.290
nande konna ni mendo kusai ndesu ka~!

00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:42.290
(kokechatta)  omoi shatai o hikiokoshi

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:46.800
(mou ikkai)  SUTAATO! doushite daro? waracchau

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:55.350
(sou da yone!)  ikou yo! shisen no
saki ni wa tomodachi ga matteru kara!

00:22:56.100 --> 00:23:00.940
AKUSERU akeru to hirogatte iku SHIN!  (saikou no!)

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:05.780
SUPIIDO APPU shichau kanjou wa mou tomanna~i!  (YEI!)

00:23:05.980 --> 00:23:10.490
marude hane ga haechatta mitai  (Wow!)

00:23:10.530 --> 00:23:13.070
GIA nante TOPPU koete motto agete

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:17.500
"seishun TSUURINGU"  doko made icchau?

00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:19.750
buon!  buon!  buon!  buon!  buoon!

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:22.540
hashiri dashichaeba iin janai?

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:24.590
buon!  buon!  buon!  buon!  buoon!

00:23:24.590 --> 00:23:27.510
todorokima~su, bakuon!!

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:35.010
Next time on Bakuon!!
Winter Break!!

